<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - Boise City Housing Auth, Idaho.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - Boise City Housing Auth, Idaho.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seattle-Northwest said it received the written award for $7.890 million of Boise City Housing Authority, Idaho revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a top yield of 5.25 percent</p>
</text>
